L0506: Cannot install generated artifacts

Locus could not write output, or found an existing Rust file without a matching ownership receipt. Choose a fresh output name/directory. Generated output belongs under target/OUT_DIR; handwritten files are preserved.

The filesystem regression is `tests/fixtures/project-errors/L0506`. Its `export.lc` reproduces this category through the actual project pipeline.

